From 7b2b75b29f6df847a301447ce1de7d4ac8494506 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Port <port@local>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 00:13:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 29/32] ASoC: codecs: lpass-macro: add SM6115/SM6225 RX, TX and
 VA

Backport the SM6115 LPASS macro compatibles from torvalds/linux
65d03e84d8b8e42cf4636fcabb81c9b130cec710 ("ASoC: dt-bindings:
qcom,lpass-rx-macro: Add sm6115 LPASS RX"),
675f41b8d1675d9a51a6dcb978ff76b95cbb4b92 ("ASoC: dt-bindings:
qcom,lpass-va-macro: Add sm6115 LPASS VA"),
8ff3dcb0e8a8bf6c41f23ed4aa62d066d3948a10 ("ASoC: codecs:
lpass-rx-macro: add SM6115 compatible") and
893e2fd509e968cc1d76caadee0f5d2f2c72f137 ("ASoC: codecs:
lpass-va-macro: add SM6115 compatible").

SM6115 has no separate "macro" vote clock in the RX and VA macro
bindings. Its clock sets are mclk/npl/dcodec/fsgen for RX and TX,
and mclk/dcodec/npl for VA. TX support and its
LPASS_MACRO_FLAG_RESET_SWR data are already present in this
Android Common 6.12 base, so only the RX and VA match-table
entries are missing.

Describe SM6225 as a SoC-specific compatible with the SM6115
fallback for all three macros. The Khaje vendor tree exposes the
same RX/TX/VA MMIO blocks and the same core/NPL clock structure,
but this is not yet a hardware-validated equivalence, so the
device tree using these fallbacks must remain disabled.

No board device tree or machine driver is added. Compile-tested
only; no macro or SoundWire probe has been verified on hardware.

Signed-off-by: Port <port@local>
---
 .../bindings/sound/qcom,lpass-rx-macro.yaml   | 23 +++++++++++++++++++
 .../bindings/sound/qcom,lpass-tx-macro.yaml   |  9 ++++++--
 .../bindings/sound/qcom,lpass-va-macro.yaml   | 22 ++++++++++++++++++
 sound/soc/codecs/lpass-rx-macro.c             |  3 +++
 sound/soc/codecs/lpass-va-macro.c             |  1 +
 5 files changed, 56 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/qcom,lpass-rx-macro.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/qcom,lpass-rx-macro.yaml
index 92f95eb74..9e4ee6e63 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/qcom,lpass-rx-macro.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/qcom,lpass-rx-macro.yaml
@@ -14,10 +14,14 @@ properties:
     oneOf:
       - enum:
           - qcom,sc7280-lpass-rx-macro
+          - qcom,sm6115-lpass-rx-macro
           - qcom,sm8250-lpass-rx-macro
           - qcom,sm8450-lpass-rx-macro
           - qcom,sm8550-lpass-rx-macro
           - qcom,sc8280xp-lpass-rx-macro
+      - items:
+          - const: qcom,sm6225-lpass-rx-macro
+          - const: qcom,sm6115-lpass-rx-macro
       - items:
           - enum:
               - qcom,sm8650-lpass-rx-macro
@@ -80,6 +84,25 @@ allOf:
                 - const: npl
                 - const: fsgen
 
+  - if:
+      properties:
+        compatible:
+          contains:
+            enum:
+              - qcom,sm6115-lpass-rx-macro
+              - qcom,sm6225-lpass-rx-macro
+    then:
+      properties:
+        clocks:
+          minItems: 4
+          maxItems: 4
+        clock-names:
+          items:
+            - const: mclk
+            - const: npl
+            - const: dcodec
+            - const: fsgen
+
   - if:
       properties:
         compatible:
